        },
        {
            "Time": 100.0,
            "Dialogue": [
                {
                    "Text": "[patterns=\"0\"][s=\"you\"]...",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Oh, sweetheart!!! How are you still standing?",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"you\"]you sound disappointed by that, gloria.",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Disappointed?? Oh no darling, FAR from the truth! I haven't had an audience this engaged in one of my performances in YEARS!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Oh, how silly of me! You are NOT my audience at all, darling...",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]YOU'RE MY LEADING CO-STAR!!!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Although, between you and me...",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Your footwork could use a little work... you keep missing your cues",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"you\"]are you ever going to shut up?",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]If I stopped talking, you'd only have yourself to listen to...  how incredibly BORING!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Anyways sweetpea, you know how the show goes.",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]The lights, the music, the screaming... and that dreadful little voice in your head, ME, telling you that you are going to flop your performance like a fish.",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"you\"]you're insufferable.",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Now, I do hope you've enjoyed the intermission!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"you\"]We're in the middle of your song STILL?!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]I KNOW!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Now, EVERYBODY!!! give our little star a BIG round of applause! A total A FOR EFFORT!!!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]...You hear that?! I hear the people insisting on an ENCOREEEEE!!!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]HOW DELIGHTFUL!!!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[patterns=\"10,11,12\"][s=\"gloria\"]PLACES, DARLING!!! LET'S MAKE A BLOODY MESS OF THINGS!!!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
